{"ts":"2026-09-07T23:38:40.186Z","author":"codex-pm-release","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6-astra","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"20bf74f12d028b633a6dbe4b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6-astra","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-07T23:38:40.186Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-07T23:38:40.186Z","author":"codex-pm-release","text":"Regression proof: the original packed package returned only 20 of 21 real TypeScript workspaces ready because pm-changelog has no self-dependency. The corrected packed package now returns 21 of 21 ready online; pm-changelog keeps has_pm_changelog=false and reports self_hosts_pm_changelog=true. Its real status is ready and all six default policy checks pass. Nine incomplete configurations and an explicit custom required-script policy are covered by the host harness; three malformed configurations were also rejected through the installed packed CLI. Full release:check passed 466 tests with zero failures and two optional real-data tests skipped, exact all-source 100/100/100/100 on 13 files, and docstrings on all 185 declarations. Types, production audit, package contents, changelog, release-date and publish-attestation gates passed. The manual fleet scan and metrics commands supplied the separate real-data evidence."}]}],"before_hash":"251743c233a11972bc72a6f6d9023ccb681a3078ed5ae011b6ba778a2fb67929","after_hash":"f42846bffa5500b55c68d3b88a9f9f21333768a2b345b0f96dd282530636c235","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"978c0732765117db62743d7c3969072c738bb86878142a627232ee8dc328fa30"}
